  "title": "Quick Roasted Sicilian Brussels Sprouts Skillet",
  "description": "A quick and flavorful Italian dish featuring roasted Brussels sprouts, perfect for a weeknight dinner. This recipe is cooked in a clay pot for a unique and delicious taste.",
