      "name": "Fresh parsley",
      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "chopped"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large clay pot, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the Brussels sprouts and cook for 5 minutes, until they start to brown.",
    "Add the red wine and chicken broth, and stir to combine.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Transfer the clay pot to the preheated oven and roast for 15 minutes, until the Brussels sprouts are tender.",
    "Remove the clay pot from the oven and stir in the chopped parsley.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
